WEBVTT

00:00:28.816 --> 00:00:32.320
was to push power
down into the hands of people,

00:00:32.361 --> 00:00:33.696
and to all of us.

00:00:34.197 --> 00:00:35.364
And it has.

00:00:35.823 --> 00:00:38.785
It has weakened yesterday's gatekeepers,

00:00:38.785 --> 00:00:41.412
music labels, news
publications, TV networks.

00:00:41.788 --> 00:00:44.499
They've all lost much
of their power and prestige.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.293
But at the same time,

00:00:47.293 --> 00:00:49.629
the internet has created
a new establishment.

00:00:50.213 --> 00:00:53.549
It's pushed power
into the broadest of platforms,

00:00:53.591 --> 00:00:54.759
like Instagram.

00:00:55.551 --> 00:00:57.178
This was unexpected.

00:00:57.804 --> 00:01:01.015
But I believe that,
over the broad arc of history,